{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_mostma_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_mostma_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"旅途的注脚","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mostma_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"6032f16f5ea3c57dd3531f4a82146b9361f6493e370260150e45d06985e47c28","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"五年前，一场天灾，将我们的深根镇毁于一旦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了圣城使者的援手，我们才得以在这片新的土地上重新繁衍生息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"五年过去了，现在，新的深根镇已经像模像样了，我们也终于能够腾出手来重振深根镇的传统艺术——雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经的深根镇中央总是摆放着我们最好的工匠的作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我希望重拾这种传统，由我们现在最好的工匠雕刻一座雕像，用这座雕像，祭奠那些没能逃过天灾的镇民们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"苏珊，你的父亲生前是镇上最好的工匠，这些年，你的努力大家也看在眼里，你愿意接过这份工作吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我——如果父亲没有被天灾......他一定有办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"但......我不知道现在的自己能不能做得到，我也不知道自己有没有做好准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"纪念那些逝去的人，这太沉重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，这对你来说是一个艰巨的挑战，只是，现在镇子上已经没有其他人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然苏珊没有把握，可以让我试一试吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"梅丽莎？！你、你怎么从拉特兰回来了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您给我的信里提到镇子打算重新建立一座雕像，我就立刻启程出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我当时跟着使者回到了圣城，但是，我心中一直还把自己当作深根镇的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，你想来负责雕像的雕刻，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，回到拉特兰后，我开始钻研雕刻技术，一直等待着能够重新为镇子出一份力的这一天到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"难为你有这个心了。既然这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"在镇子被毁灭前，竖立在镇子中央的那座雕像，就是我父亲的杰作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"那座雕像......很特殊，每个镇里人都说，靠近那座雕像，就能闻到独属于这座镇子的气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得......还原那座雕像，才是祭奠他们的最好方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你能还原那种气味吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我不确定，但是，我想试一试！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听着，苏珊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇子上剩下的人，不会永远等着你找回“特殊”的传统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时候，延续本身更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）父亲原来常去的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）虽然危险，但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，苏珊，你要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她去的方向......啧，说过火了吗，我去把她拉回来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苏珊就交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——莫斯提马小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见了，镇长，还有梅丽莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩队长和其他人还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵，他们都挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后再聊吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问，是梅丽莎小姐吗，啊，一定是你没错了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把你雕刻需要用的材料都送过来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，请问你见过一个叫莫斯提马的萨科塔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）......莫斯提马，你是特意选这个时间来的吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以莫斯提马去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她刚才上山去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕一时半会回不来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先来帮你的忙吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这么接受了她丢给你的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一次到一个新的地方，我都会像这样凑巧遇到一些和找她一样有趣的事可以做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来她是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道欸，但是莫斯提马以前就是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小的时候，我每次找她去搞爆炸，她都不会陪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是有好几次，我发现，她其实一直在远远地看着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你又是怎么认识莫斯提马的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年前，我们曾经的镇子深根镇被天灾毁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的父亲是唯二幸存的萨科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣城接到父亲的求援，派了一支小队过来接走我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那支小队，就是姐姐曾经所在的小队......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，他们的队长安多恩没有直接带走我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他带着队友，把其他幸存下来的不是萨科塔的难民，护送到了现在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还为他们向圣城申请了物资——我后来才知道，他们全队预支了一整年的工资，扛下了这件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算算时间，小乐现在应该已经在梅丽莎那里开始工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅丽莎了解的过去，或许可以稍微满足一些她的好奇心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到你了，苏珊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是父亲过去经常来的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"从这里，可以眺望整座镇子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"每当他心情不好的时候，他就会来这里，远远看着镇子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"他常说，真正的铭记不是储存信息，而是让触摸雕像的人能想起旧日的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——父亲，现在，我站在这里只能看到一片废墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座雕像，看起来还没有完全损坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去去就回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g4_mini12_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，这块石头可真大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是做一个雕像要用的石头吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。我从一开始就想好了，我想要做一组雕像，用来纪念那些逝去的人们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在拉特兰也看到过类似的雕像组吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——你是说广场上那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我想雕刻一组那样的雕像，然后，将所有遇难者的名字都收集起来刻在上面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来就像教堂里的那些壁画一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聪明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。你刚才说，你是回到拉特兰后，才开始学习雕塑的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，虽说深根镇曾经以雕塑闻名，但也不是每个人都喜欢雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是其中之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，我不太适应拉特兰的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是在深根镇生活惯了的原因，我不太能接受拉特兰那种特别欢快的氛围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是这两年追着莫斯提马到处跑的原因吧，我见到了很多拉特兰之外的风景，也知道了许多地方其实和拉特兰是不一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，我现在的愿望之一，就是找一座新的城市生活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你只是个单纯的乐天派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，回到拉特兰后，我反而开始对雕塑感兴趣，并且决定系统性地学习雕塑知识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心里想着，有一天，我会回到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——拉特兰的雕塑，和这里的雕塑不一样吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我当然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我开始系统性地学习雕塑后，我就没有一天不在悔恨——我应该趁原来的深根镇还在的时候，学习那里的雕塑技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是事已至此，我情愿用拉特兰的技术来延续这里的传统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非有人能找到更好的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，你其实希望苏珊能做到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......开玩笑，我可不希望自己这五年的刻苦学习白费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这块最大的石头，放这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，既然你要帮忙的话，就先从把石头切割成我要的大小开始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，用拉特兰的方法来说，就是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆破！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我就知道。你只要别把它变成一堆粉末就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我可是爆破高手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_y"},{"type":"narration","text":"街道早已被岁月冲刷得面目全非、泥泞不堪，四处散落着砖块和瓦砾，放眼望去，处处都是天灾留下的痕迹。\n即使是最有经验的信使，也会选择小心翼翼地绕开这样危险的地方，但莫斯提马只是紧了紧帽檐，就毫不犹豫地踏入其中。\n短短两年时间，她就已经过于熟悉这样的环境了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"如果是五年前的自己，恐怕此时并不会多此一举，不如说，她甚至不会站在这里，她想。\n但是，这两年，作为万国信使，她踏过了太多前所未见的土地，见过了太多闻所未闻的轶事。\n在踏足这片区域时，她已经隐隐对苏珊的话有了一些猜测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那种气味的答案，或许很简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧，看来你也这么想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫斯提马轻快地来到废墟中央的雕像前，小心地从雕像上取下一片残留的外壳，闻了闻。\n然后，她又蹲下挖起一抔土壤，闻了闻。\n和她想的一样。\n所谓“镇子的气味”，它的秘方并不复杂——\n它只是这片土地的土壤和雕塑用的石料混合后散发出的味道。\n让镇民们感到亲切的原因也很简单，它既有这一带植被留在土壤里的清新气息，又有石料本身独特的矿物味。\n二者都是镇民们最常闻到的气息，将它们混合起来，就成了独属于生活在这片土地上的人所怀念的气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，不是什么好闻的气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......我们走过了那么多的地方，这种气味确实很独特，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了——炸药设置完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据我的精密计算，它炸开后，一定可以达成你要的结果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看不出来，你还真是这方面的行家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，我说了，我可是搞爆破的专家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就开始吧，我按！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾缪乐的计算确实十分精确。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着几声爆破声，巨大的石头恰如其分地裂成了数份。\n唯一的问题是——她忘了石头的材质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，忘了提醒你，这种石头爆破后会产生大量的粉尘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铺天盖地的粉尘笼罩了蕾缪乐，让她一时间睁不开眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哇哇，我什么也看不见了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我睁不开眼了，梅丽莎，快来扶我一下呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，当心！那边有坑——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？哇啊——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾缪乐感到自己脚一崴，身体瞬间失衡，眼看就要摔进旁边的坑里。\n但就在这时，一只手抓住了她的手臂，将她拉了回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅丽莎，谢谢你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小乐，你可要小心一些才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，莫斯提马？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"听到那个熟悉的声音，她立刻使劲揉了揉眼，强行睁开了眼睛。\n然而，眼前空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳呸呸呸，莫斯提马？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅丽莎，刚才莫斯提马来过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸？怎么梅丽莎也不见了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这到底是怎么回事啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这个气味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，就是这个气味......唔哦哦......呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是过去的深根镇的气味啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实是那种气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到它的原理居然这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越是简单的东西，反而越容易被铭记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不得不谢谢你们找回它，莫斯提马，苏珊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......我才要谢谢你，梅丽莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"没有你，我或许会一直在原地打转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，别高兴得太早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这种气味的原理这么简单，那么，我为什么不能用上它呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很卑鄙嘛，梅丽莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苏珊，你不会以为自己找到了那股气味，镇民们就会选择你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我会雕刻出最好的雕像的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朴实的镇长","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不知道该怎么感谢你，莫斯提马，你为镇子找回了熟悉的气味，又为镇子注入了活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说得太过了，镇长，这一切......都和我没有必然联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我确实有些好奇，莫斯提马。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年前，你跟在那位安多恩队长的后面一言不发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么今天，忽然就跑来为我们做这些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"narration","text":"当她赶到现场的时候，看到的是狂乱的安多恩重伤了蕾缪安。\n在那一瞬间，她捕捉到了许多情绪——有困惑、狂躁，也有释然、包容。\n这让她心生疑惑，但并没有妨碍她的行动。\n为了阻止安多恩，她最终只能使用守护铳，将锁与匙从他手中打落，并在夺取锁与匙后，带着蕾缪安离开。\n在菲亚梅塔的陪同下，她们一起回到了拉特兰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g8_laterano_dwelling"},{"type":"narration","text":"随后，锁与匙被收回，她也遭到了软禁。\n对于堕天，她完全没有后悔过。更让她在意的，始终是安多恩究竟在锁与匙之中看到了什么。\n于是，她作出了一个大胆的决定——硬闯教皇厅。\n毕竟，错过这次机会，她恐怕再也没有机会探明这个秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall"},{"type":"narration","text":"闯入教皇厅并不是那么容易的事，不过她最终还是成功了——\n当然，现在想来，这显然是那位白胡子老头有意为之。不然的话，他也不会将锁与匙交给她来保管。\n无论如何，她再次见到了锁与匙。\n当她从安多恩手中将其夺下时，双杖并没有对她作出反应。\n而这一次，当她带着疑问再次触碰双杖，她走入了一片幻境之中。\n在那里，她看到了——\n过去的缝隙。未来的断面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老实说，她对于安多恩看到了什么有大概的猜测。\n而在幻境中见到那些景象后，她立刻理解了，为什么安多恩会陷入癫狂。\n毕竟，那可是永远对未来忧心忡忡，永远会为一个十分微小的悲剧而扼腕叹息的安多恩。\n某种意义上，她甚至可以说，菲亚梅塔如此愤怒于安多恩的作为，恰恰是源自菲亚梅塔对过去的他的认可——\n很显然，对于心怀正义的菲亚梅塔而言，悲天悯人的安多恩比总是游离于事态之外的她要值得认可得多。\n但对莫斯提马而言，她并不执着于安多恩为何陷入狂乱，并不单纯是因为那一刻，她从那两人身上捕捉到的情绪。\n更多的是因为，她从一开始——或许是加入安多恩的小队，甚至是见到安多恩的那一瞬间，就已经隐隐有一种感觉——\n安多恩走在和她完全相反的道路上，他迟早会和自己分道扬镳。\n就像那时，眼前是万千的碎片，每一块碎片都可能预示着一个问题的答案，或许穷尽所有的碎片，终极问题的答案也将自然而然浮现。\n安多恩必然会毫不犹豫地选择走向那些碎片，踏入那片闪烁着繁星的漆黑沼泽。\n而她——选择了回头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次，看到那幅光景的时候，我在想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真惨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除此之外，我无法产生更多的感想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以至于我并不能理解某人当时的挣扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马姐姐，你的角，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稳重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你堕天了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两年，作为万国信使，我一直在外面旅行，最后，我得出了一个结论——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，朋友，萨科塔真是一群可爱的混账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在了解自己是个混账之后......重新学着和这片大地相处罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，记得替我告诉小乐，我接到了新的任务，下一站，要去龙门待一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，半年前在旅途中遇到过一个叫大帝的家伙，他也在龙门，可以去拜访他一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"narration","text":"走到山坡上，莫斯提马回过头。\n从这里，隐约能够看到广场上发生的事。\n广场上，苏珊和梅丽莎已经各自开始了准备，越来越多的人被二人行为吸引，在广场上聚集起来。\n在所有人之中，有一个红发萨科塔特别显眼，她在两边走来走去，这边帮一下，那边帮一下，俨然忘了自己的初衷。\n莫斯提马难得地没有戴起兜帽，任由微风拂过她的脸颊，吹起她的发梢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
